    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1605290/extras/4e5ecac476b773cc7bbd10338908c6e8.avif?t=1745917799\" /></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1605290/extras/f2d805d1ea23316d5fb4c6ae473e27a9.avif?t=1745917799\" /></div><br><br>The team of artists has just received an invitation to the Intergalactic Painting Tournament!<br>Will they disgrace their planet or return home to adoring fans as champions?<br>Choose from 1000+ pictures and PAINT BY NUMBERS to bring them to life! <br>Colorful pixel art adventures are coming!  <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1605290/extras/847476557097aac50314a6a9a984faf1.poster.avif?t=1745917799\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1605290/extras/847476557097aac50314a6a9a984faf1.webm?t=1745917799\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1605290/extras/847476557097aac50314a6a9a984faf1.mp4?t=1745917799\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><strong><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Beautiful pixel artworks on exotic locations<br></li><li> Handy mini-map<br></li><li> Filler, Blockbuster, and Rainbow Crayon useful tools<br></li><li> Smart alphanumeric colors numeration<br></li><li> Smooth animations and beautiful special effects<br></li><li> Thematic musical accompaniment<br></li><li> Lifelike pictures after painting</li></ul></strong>",
